{"4320870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Animonia", "steam_appid": 4320870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Animonia, Animons have always existed quietly alongside humans. One day, a legendary Animon enters your hero’s dreams, unknowingly pulling them into a grand adventure. Explore a colorful, stylized world, capture and train creatures, and engage in both cooperative and competitive encounters. Start your journey and experience the first chapter of an epic adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creature Collection &amp; Training:</strong> Encounter diverse Animons in their natural habitats and evolve them to gain unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action-Oriented Combat:</strong> Dynamic third-person battles with cinematic camera angles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong> Discover forests, ruins, and hidden secrets in a vibrant open world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression &amp; Customization:</strong> Personalize your character and creatures as you grow stronger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvE &amp; PvP:</strong> Engage in cooperative challenges or test your skills against other players.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why Play?</strong><br>Animonia offers a blend of creature collection, strategic combat, and exploration in a rich fantasy world. Perfect for players who love adventure, discovery, and long-term progression.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Animonia, Animons have always existed quietly alongside humans. One day, a legendary Animon enters your hero’s dreams, unknowingly pulling them into a grand adventure. Explore a colorful, stylized world, capture and train creatures, and engage in both cooperative and competitive encounters. Start your journey and experience the first chapter of an epic adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creature Collection &amp; Training:</strong> Encounter diverse Animons in their natural habitats and evolve them to gain unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action-Oriented Combat:</strong> Dynamic third-person battles with cinematic camera angles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong> Discover forests, ruins, and hidden secrets in a vibrant open world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression &amp; Customization:</strong> Personalize your character and creatures as you grow stronger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvE &amp; PvP:</strong> Engage in cooperative challenges or test your skills against other players.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why Play?</strong><br>Animonia offers a blend of creature collection, strategic combat, and exploration in a rich fantasy world. Perfect for players who love adventure, discovery, and long-term progression.</p>", "short_description": "Step into the world of Animonia, where mysterious creatures roam and a legendary Animon enters your dreams. Embark on an unexpected adventure, discover magical beings, and shape your journey as you play and experience the game.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320870/b56031f58bfdb2a03dfe7edf55db0cdfb8a3dd1d/header.jpg?t=1777642081", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320870/b7ed21459777d89d39ebab240769c87968ec2b6f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777642081", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4320870/b7ed21459777d89d39ebab240769c87968ec2b6f/c